const additional = [
  ["kejimkujik","Kejimkujik","CA","Canada","north-america",["nova-scotia","north-america"],"America/Halifax",83,["forest","dark-sky","national-park","lake"],"Kejimkujik National Park Nova Scotia",["annapolis-royal","Annapolis Royal",44.741,-65.515],[["jeremys-bay-kejimkujik","Jeremy's Bay Campground",44.408,-65.245,95,"campground","limited",78,"https://parks.canada.ca/pn-np/ns/kejimkujik/activ/camping"],["sky-circle-kejimkujik","Kejimkujik Sky Circle",44.405,-65.25,90,"astronomy-area","limited",72,"https://parks.canada.ca/pn-np/ns/kejimkujik/activ/decouverte-tours/etoile-star"]],["https://parks.canada.ca/pn-np/ns/kejimkujik/activ/decouverte-tours/etoile-star","https://parks.canada.ca/pn-np/ns/kejimkujik/activ/camping","https://parks.canada.ca/pn-np/ns/kejimkujik/visit/conditions"],"A forest night at Kejimkujik's Sky Circle","Eine Waldnacht am Sky Circle in Kejimkujik","Kejimkujik places its astronomy inside a forest and lake landscape rather than on an exposed summit. The Sky Circle is the clearest programme-led choice. Jeremy's Bay works for campers who can keep the session inside their legal overnight plan.","Kejimkujik legt seine Astronomie in eine Wald- und Seenlandschaft statt auf einen exponierten Gipfel. Der Sky Circle ist die klarste programmgebundene Wahl. Jeremy's Bay passt für Camper, die die Sitzung in ihren legalen Übernachtungsplan integrieren.","Seasonal operations, insects, fog, wildlife and wooded navigation make a confirmed programme or campsite more valuable than a random clearing.","Saisonbetrieb, Insekten, Nebel, Wildtiere und Navigation im Wald machen ein bestätigtes Programm oder einen Stellplatz wertvoller als irgendeine Lichtung.","Check the Sky Circle schedule or reserve Jeremy's Bay, walk the short route before dusk and keep the return entirely within the known campground network.","Prüfe den Sky-Circle-Termin oder reserviere Jeremy's Bay, gehe die kurze Route vor der Dämmerung und halte den Rückweg vollständig im bekannten Campingnetz.","Protect Mi'kmaw cultural context, quiet hours, shoreline habitat and other campers' dark adaptation.","Respektiere Mi'kmaw-Kulturkontext, Ruhezeiten, Uferlebensräume und die Dunkeladaption anderer Camper.","A cancelled programme or wet, foggy forest moves the evening under shelter instead of to an unmarked lakeshore.","Ein abgesagtes Programm oder nasser, nebliger Wald verlagert den Abend in den Schutz statt an ein unmarkiertes Ufer."],
  ["mayo-dark-sky","Mayo Dark Sky Park","IE","Ireland","europe",["county-mayo","europe"],"Europe/Dublin",82,["peatland","dark-sky","atlantic","accessible"],"Mayo Dark Sky Park Ireland",["newport-mayo","Newport, County Mayo",53.886,-9.546],[["claggan-mountain-coastal-trail","Claggan Mountain Coastal Trail",53.95745,-9.79335,20,"coastal-trailhead","yes",80,"https://www.mayodarkskypark.ie/visit/"],["brogan-carroll-bothy","Brogan Carroll Bothy",53.98932,-9.57282,90,"dark-sky-viewpoint","yes",78,"https://www.mayodarkskypark.ie/visit/"]],["https://www.mayodarkskypark.ie/visit/","https://www.mayodarkskypark.ie/events/","https://www.wildnephinnationalpark.ie/"],"An Atlantic dark-sky night with a dry return","Eine Atlantik-Dark-Sky-Nacht mit trockenem Rückweg","Mayo's official viewing points sit in a wet Atlantic landscape where low elevation does not mean simple conditions. Claggan offers a coastal approach. Brogan Carroll Bothy shifts the experience inland and should be chosen before departure, not after cloud arrives.","Mayos offizielle Aussichtspunkte liegen in einer nassen Atlantiklandschaft, in der geringe Höhe keine einfachen Bedingungen bedeutet. Claggan bietet einen Küstenzugang. Brogan Carroll Bothy verlagert das Erlebnis ins Inland und wird vor der Abfahrt gewählt, nicht erst bei Wolken.","Fast showers, saturated ground, wind and weak mobile coverage can matter more than the climatological monthly score.","Schnelle Schauer, durchnässter Boden, Wind und schwacher Mobilfunk können wichtiger sein als der klimatologische Monatswert.","Start from Newport with offline directions, inspect the chosen path in daylight and set a firm return time before rain reduces visibility.","Starte in Newport mit Offline-Navigation, prüfe den gewählten Weg bei Tageslicht und setze eine feste Rückkehrzeit, bevor Regen die Sicht mindert.","Remain on signed routes, close gates, keep peat and coastal vegetation intact and direct light away from homes.","Bleibe auf beschilderten Routen, schließe Tore, schütze Torf und Küstenvegetation und richte Licht von Häusern weg.","When Atlantic cloud closes in, a village-based evening is the sensible fallback; moving between remote sites rarely restores a useful sky.","Wenn Atlantikwolken schließen, ist ein Abend im Ort die sinnvolle Alternative. Wechsel zwischen abgelegenen Orten bringt selten einen brauchbaren Himmel zurück."],
  ["eryri","Eryri","GB","United Kingdom","europe",["wales","europe"],"Europe/London",84,["mountain","dark-sky","national-park","cloud-variable"],"Eryri Snowdonia Wales",["beddgelert","Beddgelert",53.011,-4.101],[["llyn-y-dywarchen","Llyn y Dywarchen",53.074,-4.146,250,"lake-viewpoint","yes",78,"https://snowdonia.gov.wales/discover/dark-skies/"],["bwlch-y-groes-dark-sky","Bwlch y Groes",52.715,-3.582,545,"mountain-pass","limited",60,"https://snowdonia.gov.wales/discover/dark-skies/"]],["https://snowdonia.gov.wales/discover/dark-skies/","https://snowdonia.gov.wales/visit/plan-your-visit/","https://snowdonia.gov.wales/visit/safety/"],"Eryri from a lake edge, not a summit at night","Eryri vom Seeufer statt vom Gipfel bei Nacht","Eryri does not require a night summit to produce a powerful sky. Llyn y Dywarchen offers a lower, legible landscape. Bwlch y Groes is exposed and only belongs in a plan backed by current road, weather and parking information.","Eryri braucht keinen Nachtgipfel für einen eindrucksvollen Himmel. Llyn y Dywarchen bietet eine niedrigere, lesbare Landschaft. Bwlch y Groes ist exponiert und gehört nur in einen Plan mit aktuellen Straßen-, Wetter- und Parkinformationen.","Mountain weather, narrow roads, livestock and water edges make a daytime reconnaissance essential even for short sessions.","Bergwetter, schmale Straßen, Weidetiere und Wasserkanten machen eine Erkundung bei Tageslicht selbst für kurze Sitzungen notwendig.","Base in Beddgelert, use Llyn y Dywarchen as the fixed destination and avoid linking several passes after dark.","Nutze Beddgelert als Basis, Llyn y Dywarchen als festen Zielort und verbinde nachts nicht mehrere Pässe.","Park only where permitted, leave gates as found and keep light and noise away from farms and wildlife.","Parke nur erlaubt, hinterlasse Tore wie vorgefunden und halte Licht sowie Lärm von Höfen und Wildtieren fern.","Rain, fog or standing water means returning to Beddgelert; a higher road is not a reliable escape from Welsh weather.","Regen, Nebel oder stehendes Wasser bedeuten die Rückkehr nach Beddgelert. Eine höhere Straße ist kein verlässlicher Ausweg aus walisischem Wetter."],
  ["yorkshire-dales","Yorkshire Dales","GB","United Kingdom","europe",["england","europe"],"Europe/London",80,["upland","dark-sky","villages","accessible"],"Yorkshire Dales National Park England",["hawes","Hawes",54.304,-2.202],[["hawes-dark-sky","Dales Countryside Museum, Hawes",54.303,-2.201,255,"visitor-centre-grounds","limited",76,"https://www.yorkshiredales.org.uk/things-to-do/whats-on/dark-skies/"],["malham-national-park-centre","Malham National Park Centre",54.061,-2.153,205,"visitor-centre-grounds","limited",74,"https://www.yorkshiredales.org.uk/park-authority/living-and-working/planning-policy/dark-skies/"]],["https://www.yorkshiredales.org.uk/things-to-do/whats-on/dark-skies/","https://www.yorkshiredales.org.uk/park-authority/living-and-working/planning-policy/dark-skies/","https://www.yorkshiredales.org.uk/plan-your-visit/essential-information/"],"A Dales evening anchored to a village","Ein Dales-Abend mit fester Dorfbasis","The Yorkshire Dales are easiest to use when astronomy is tied to a village and a confirmed event or visitor-centre arrangement. Hawes offers that relationship clearly. Malham is a separate base, not a second stop on the same late-night circuit.","Die Yorkshire Dales lassen sich am besten nutzen, wenn Astronomie an ein Dorf und eine bestätigte Veranstaltung oder Besucherzentrum-Regelung gebunden ist. Hawes bietet diese Verbindung klar. Malham ist eine eigene Basis und kein zweiter Stopp derselben späten Runde.","Dry-stone walls, livestock, narrow lanes, cloud and private land boundaries punish improvised roadside observing.","Trockenmauern, Weidetiere, schmale Gassen, Wolken und Privatgrundstücke bestrafen spontane Straßenrandbeobachtung.","Stay in Hawes, confirm whether the museum grounds or an official event can be used and walk back within the settled area.","Übernachte in Hawes, bestätige die Nutzbarkeit des Museumsgeländes oder einer offiziellen Veranstaltung und gehe innerhalb des Ortes zurück.","Never block farm access, climb walls or direct lights into houses; public rights of way do not create a camping right.","Blockiere niemals Hofzufahrten, klettere nicht über Mauern und richte kein Licht in Häuser. Öffentliche Wege schaffen kein Campingrecht.","Low cloud should turn the evening into a village stay rather than a drive through unfamiliar dales looking for a gap.","Tiefe Wolken machen den Abend zu einem Aufenthalt im Dorf statt zu einer Fahrt durch unbekannte Dales auf der Suche nach einer Lücke."],
  ["south-downs","South Downs","GB","United Kingdom","europe",["england","europe"],"Europe/London",79,["chalk-downland","dark-sky","accessible","near-city"],"South Downs National Park England",["petersfield","Petersfield",51.005,-0.933],[["old-winchester-hill","Old Winchester Hill",50.978,-1.088,198,"hilltop-car-park","limited",70,"https://www.southdowns.gov.uk/dark-night-skies/where-to-stargaze/"],["iping-common-dark-sky","Iping Common",50.995,-0.784,55,"nature-reserve-car-park","limited",66,"https://www.southdowns.gov.uk/dark-night-skies/where-to-stargaze/"]],["https://www.southdowns.gov.uk/dark-night-skies/where-to-stargaze/","https://www.southdowns.gov.uk/dark-night-skies/","https://www.southdowns.gov.uk/getting-around/"],"A South Downs session that respects the last mile","Eine South-Downs-Sitzung mit Respekt für den letzten Kilometer","South Downs darkness exists close to towns, villages and sensitive chalk habitat. Old Winchester Hill gives elevation and an official discovery-site context. Iping Common is lower and ecologically delicate, so current parking and reserve guidance must be read literally.","Die Dunkelheit der South Downs liegt nahe an Städten, Dörfern und empfindlichem Kalkrasen. Old Winchester Hill bietet Höhe und den Kontext eines offiziellen Discovery Site. Iping Common liegt tiefer und ist ökologisch sensibel, daher gelten aktuelle Park- und Reservatshinweise wörtlich.","Car-park gates, residents, livestock, muddy paths and nature-reserve restrictions decide whether the final kilometre works.","Parkplatztore, Anwohner, Weidetiere, schlammige Wege und Naturschutzregeln entscheiden, ob der letzte Kilometer funktioniert.","Choose one official stargazing site, inspect its return path before twilight and finish before transport or parking restrictions become uncertain.","Wähle einen offiziellen Stargazing-Ort, prüfe seinen Rückweg vor der Dämmerung und beende die Sitzung, bevor Transport- oder Parkregeln unsicher werden.","Use the smallest practical light, stay on paths and keep voices, vehicles and tripods away from homes and protected vegetation.","Nutze das kleinste praktikable Licht, bleibe auf Wegen und halte Stimmen, Fahrzeuge sowie Stative von Häusern und geschützter Vegetation fern.","If access is unclear, observe from the accommodation area rather than treating another rural car park as interchangeable.","Bei unklarem Zugang beobachte nahe der Unterkunft, statt einen anderen ländlichen Parkplatz als austauschbar zu behandeln."],
];

